{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br>  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665460/extras/explore.png?t=1744647984\" /><strong><i>Sail into a vast, procedurally generated world where freedom is at the heart of every adventure.</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A World to Discover:</strong> Start as a young, unaffiliated captain with an entire world open for exploration. Every campaign features a unique, procedurally generated map, ensuring no two games are alike.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play Solo or Co-op:</strong> Experience it all alone or sail with friends\u2014the choice is yours.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665460/extras/img0b.jpg?t=1744647984\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Trade, Quest, or Wander:</strong> Engage in peaceful trading, take on quests for various factions, fish the seas, or dive for hidden treasures. Prefer a quieter life? You can simply sail and enjoy the open waters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic World Impact:</strong> Towns and provinces need resources to grow. Supplying them leads to prosperity, while faction leaders will involve you in their agendas. Helping one may hinder another, and enough support can even let a faction leader take control of a province\u2014without a single cannon fired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665460/extras/img4b.jpg?t=1744647984\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665460/extras/battle_1.png?t=1744647984\" />  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>In Windward Horizon, your ship is your character, and how you approach combat is entirely up to you.</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fully Customizable Ships:</strong> Build the ship that suits your style\u2014whether it\u2019s a tough juggernaut that can take a beating, a quick schooner that rains fire from afar, or a support vessel keeping allies afloat. Swap out cannons for extra armor and turn your ship into a ramming machine if that\u2019s your thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665460/extras/img3a.jpg?t=1744647984\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Talent Trees:</strong> As you level up, unlock talent points to enhance <strong>Defense</strong>, <strong>Offense</strong>, or <strong>Support</strong> specializations. Each tree offers unique abilities and sub-paths, and you can mix talents across specializations to create powerful, personalized builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crew &amp; Captains:</strong> Expand your toolkit by recruiting crew, mates, and captains\u2014each bringing their skills to your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665460/extras/img1b.jpg?t=1744647984\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665460/extras/sic_1_.png?t=1744647984\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Every legendary captain starts somewhere.</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade &amp; Expand:</strong> The gold you earn isn\u2019t just for supplies\u2014it\u2019s your ticket to bigger and better ships. From nimble <strong>Schooners</strong> to powerful <strong>Frigates</strong> and versatile <strong>Brigantines</strong>. Follow storylines to unlock even more unique ships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forge Your Path:</strong> Whether you aim to be a feared pirate, a master trader, or a loyal faction ally, it's up to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Designed for Co-op:</strong> While the journey is yours, it\u2019s even better with friends. <strong>Windward Horizon</strong> was built with co-op in mind\u2014so bring your crew, set sail, and plunder some booty together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665460/extras/ships.jpg?t=1744647984\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2665460?t=1744647984","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744647984","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665460/784e8e6479508d3a01a99796e0091817fcd38804/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744647984","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665460/784e8e6479508d3a01a99796e0091817fcd38804/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744647984","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>LFG? Not anymore! Join our server!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br>  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/266