 ally, it's up to you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Designed for Co-op:</strong> While the journey is yours, it\u2019s even better with friends. <strong>Windward Horizon</strong> was built with co-op in mind\u2014so bring your crew, set sail, and plunder some booty together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665460/extras/ships.jpg?t=1744647984\" /></p></li></ul>","developers":["Tasharen Entertainment Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2665460/5996011757d01e57ca5eb98e509cbbbb17371511/header.jpg?t=1744647984","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 4790k<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960M<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel 10th gen or AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256977803,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256977803/movie480.mp4?t=1739925641","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256977803/movie_max.mp4?t=1739925641"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256977803/7276e91a4616b7977e92f810d3b4ae43ce535144/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739925641","we